      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@$\\mathbb{K}$,Type),Type.annotation(@V,Type),LA.Field($\\mathbb{K}$),LA.VectorSpace(V,$\\mathbb{K}$),Type.annotation(@x,V),Type.annotation(@hIP,InnerProductSpace($\\mathbb{K}$,V))),def(norm(x),,$\\|x\\| = \\sqrt{\\operatorname{Re}\\langle x,x\\rangle}$))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "$\\|x\\|$ 是 $x$ 的范数；在内积空间中由内积给出 $\\|x\\|=\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Re}\\langle x,x\\rangle}$。并非所有范数都来自内积，此式只在内积空间成立。",
          "en": "$\\|x\\|$ is the norm of $x$; in an inner product space it is given by $\\|x\\|=\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Re}\\langle x,x\\rangle}$. Not every norm arises from an inner product, so this identity is only valid in an inner product space."
        }
